      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(restart): keep deferring when pending inspection fails",
        "body": "Fixes #104064.\n\nSummary:\n- Treat pending-count inspection exceptions as unknown pending work instead of safe-to-restart.\n- Keep the existing deferral lifecycle active after both initial and later getPendingCount failures.\n- Continue polling until a later check confirms idle, or until the explicit maxWaitMs timeout forces the existing timeout path.\n\nRoot cause:\n- deferGatewayRestartUntilIdle emitted a prepared restart immediately when getPendingCount threw.\n- That fail-open path could restart the gateway while active work still existed but could not be inspected.\n\nBehavior after this patch:\n- Initial inspection throw: calls onCheckError, enters deferral with pending=1, and polls again.\n- Later polling throw: calls onCheckError, keeps the interval registered, and retries on the next poll.\n- Confirmed pending=0 still emits restart through the normal ready path.\n- Explicit maxWaitMs still preserves the existing forced-timeout behavior.\n\nReal behavior proof outside Vitest:\n\nPROOF_RESTART_PENDING_INSPECTION=PASS\ninitial_throw_then_ready={\"events\":[\"check-error:store corrupted\",\"deferring:1\",\"ready\"],\"immediateReason\":null,\"finalReason\":\"proof.initial-inspection\"}\npolling_throw_then_ready={\"events\":[\"deferring:2\",\"check-error:queue unavailable\",\"ready\"],\"midReason\":null,\"finalReason\":\"proof.poll-inspection\"}\n\nValidation:\n- node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/infra/restart.deferral-timeout.test.ts -> passed; 8 tests\n- ./node_modules/.bin/oxlint src/infra/restart.ts src/infra/restart.deferral-timeout.test.ts -> passed\n- git diff --check -> passed\n\nNote:\n- node scripts/run-tsgo.mjs -p test/tsconfig/tsconfig.core.test.non-agents.json was attempted, but current main fails in unrelated UI CodeMirror imports under ui/src/pages/chat/components/file-editor-view.ts before reaching this infra change.\n",
        "branch": "fix/104064-restart-pending-inspection",
        "head_sha": "a40c569f85c793522bbc977f69f35e62cda9d860",
